OL,3,GNEWSANational Trust takes back land for
OL,4,Anature restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 370-acre (150-hectare) area of land
OL,7,Fon the edge of Cambridge has been
OL,8,Freturned to the care of the National
OL,9,FTrust - for the first time in 60 years.
OL,11,FThe area - known as Northfield - runs
OL,12,Falongside the opposite side of Quy Road
OL,13,Ftowards Bottisham, seven miles (11km)
OL,14,Ffrom the city and close to Anglesey
OL,15,FAbbey.
OL,17,FThe National Trust hopes to restore the
OL,18,Fnatural site to create new wildlife
OL,19,Fhabitats and improve community access
OL,20,Fto green space.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
