OL,3,GNEWSANational Trust takes back land for
OL,4,Anature restoration
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Ormond-Bones, general manager of
OL,7,Fthe National Trust's North
OL,8,FCambridgeshire Portfolio, said: "We
OL,9,Fwant Northfield to become a place where
OL,10,Fnature can thrive, helping wildlife
OL,11,Frecover and building resilience to a
OL,12,Fchanging climate."
